    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 14 occurrences, first LEV.23.39; Keita 1979, p. 115: Kiöndöö; Lexique kissi–français, p. 24: kiɔndɔɔ/ kiɔndu, kendu, kiandu; Childs 2000, p. 170: kìòndɔ̀ɔ́</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="ko_2158">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>ko</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="check"/>
    <sense id="ko_2158_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Particle"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>justement ; comme si ; (vana ca ko) on dirait</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>just; as if; (vana ca ko) it is as if</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="9.2.6 Particles"/>
    </sense>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Hau ko ya co ndi tueyɔɔ nuaa ni « c'est aujourd'hui seulement que je l'apprends » (Gn 21,26).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="kó_2159">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>kó</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="southern"/>
    <sense id="kó_2159_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Particle"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>(je me demande) si ; exprime le doute</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>(I wonder) if, whether; expresses doubt</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="9.2.6 Particles"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Childs 2000, p. 171: kó</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="koavaa_2160">
