    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Keita 1979, p. 139: Kpandilen; Paulme 1964, p. 77 (G/K): padile /G./, gbadile, gbandile /K./; Lexique kissi–français, p. 28: kpandilen; Childs 2000, p. 205: kpàndìwéèŋndéŋ</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Paulme 1964, p. 77 : padile /G./, gbadile, gbandile /K./ « patate ». Paulme : padile /G./, gbadile, gbandile /K./ (p. 77).</text></form></note>
