    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 13 occurrences, first NUM.29.26; Paulme 1964, p. 69 (G/K): nɔma nwɔlu /K./, nɔma yɔlɔ /G./; Lexique kissi–français, p. 40: ŋɔmahɔɔlu; Childs 2000, p. 270: ŋɔ̀máhìɔ́ɔ́lú</text></form></note>
